OL,3,GNEWSAPictures show aftermath of fire
OL,4,Athat gutted library
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being asked to avoid the
OL,7,Farea around a former library that was
OL,8,Fgutted by a blaze.
OL,10,FCleveland Fire Service and Cleveland
OL,11,FPolice were called to Billingham's
OL,12,Fformer library, at the back of
OL,13,FBillingham Health Centre, in Queensway,
OL,14,Fon Tuesday evening.
OL,16,FImages from the scene showed the
OL,17,Fbuilding well alight while fire crews
OL,18,Fworked to extinguish the flames. The
OL,19,Ffire was brought under control and
OL,20,Froads around the area reopened on
OL,21,FWednesday.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
