OL,3,GNEWSAPictures show aftermath of fire
OL,4,Athat gutted library
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Cleveland Police
OL,7,Fsaid: "Emergency services remain on the
OL,8,Fscene and disruption around the area is
OL,9,Fstill likely as we secure the scene and
OL,10,Fsupport fire and rescue colleagues."
